{"id":"n86940-21-5","stage":1,"title":"걸리다 · 花费","scene":"赶时间要求加快行驶","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n86940-21-5-1","ko":"시간이 너무 많이 걸리네요. 좀 더 빨리 갈 수는 없나요?","zh":"时间也太长了吧。没办法开快一点吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"시간이","meaning":"时间","explanation":"시간：时间；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62841","senseId":"4","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시간이","audio":"/audio/cecaa2f0353f97459090.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太。","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多。","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"걸리네요.","meaning":"花时间","explanation":"시간이 걸리다：花费时间；-네요 表示说话人对耗时的感叹。","readings":[{"term":"걸리다","audio":"/audio/d94590a358564fb83462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86940","senseId":"21","lemma":"걸리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걸리네요","audio":"/audio/817f575ba8d050163417.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一点、稍微","explanation":"좀：程度稍微一点；좀 더 빨리 是“再快一点”，不是“一会儿”。","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"1","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加。","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}},{"text":"빨리","meaning":"快，赶快","explanation":"빨리：快，赶快。","readings":[{"term":"빨리","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57305","senseId":"1","lemma":"빨리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빨리","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3"}},{"text":"갈","meaning":"行驶、开得","explanation":"가다：车辆行驶；-ㄹ 与 수 없다 组成“不能……吗”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"2","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갈","audio":"/audio/eb4ba4907fe859283419.mp3"}},{"text":"수는","meaning":"能不能","explanation":"-ㄹ 수 없다：不能；는 在这里带比较或强调语气，询问能否再快一点。","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수는","audio":"/audio/0ae6625dd24dc5dcc565.mp3"}},{"text":"없나요?","meaning":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","explanation":"없다：不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없나요","audio":"/audio/bb881468b72eb5f65cff.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"4692cef5ac69eb37","term":"시간","zh":"时间","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3","entryId":"62841","definition":"某件事从开始到结束的间隔期间。","pronunciation":["시간"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"d94590a358564fb8","term":"걸리다","zh":"花费，消耗","audio":"/audio/d94590a358564fb83462.mp3","entryId":"86940","definition":"需要消磨时间。","pronunciation":["걸리다"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一点、稍微","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"表示程度稍微；좀 더 빨리 是“再快一点”。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"更，更加","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"与比较对象或某个标准相比，程度加深；在那之上。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"a5443c04aa0fdc08","term":"빨리","zh":"快，赶快","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3","entryId":"57305","definition":"花费的时间不长地。","pronunciation":["빨리"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"行驶","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"车、船等交通工具向目的地行驶；这里问能否开快一点。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/963a08989bc6f8c751a3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n86940-21-5-2","ko":"죄송합니다. 이미 최고 속도로 가고 있습니다.","zh":"很抱歉，已经以最高速度行驶了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"죄송합니다.","meaning":"抱歉，愧疚","explanation":"죄송하다：抱歉，愧疚；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"죄송하다","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91763","senseId":"1","lemma":"죄송하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"죄송합니다","audio":"/audio/46ce53f2332052b62c9f.mp3"}},{"text":"이미","meaning":"已经","explanation":"이미：已经。","readings":[{"term":"이미","audio":"/audio/1d333b8427106c200840.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71159","senseId":"1","lemma":"이미","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이미","audio":"/audio/1d333b8427106c200840.mp3"}},{"text":"최고","meaning":"最高的","explanation":"최고：最高；최고 속도 是“最高速度”。","readings":[{"term":"최고","audio":"/audio/97b8be84b3d009c4b9b1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47976","senseId":"2","lemma":"최고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"최고","audio":"/audio/97b8be84b3d009c4b9b1.mp3"}},{"text":"속도로","meaning":"以……速度","explanation":"속도：速度；-로 表示行驶时采用的速度。","readings":[{"term":"속도","audio":"/audio/c03f7e871a4127c448d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64215","senseId":"1","lemma":"속도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"속도로","audio":"/audio/e1cd12d0784412a8c08b.mp3"}},{"text":"가고","meaning":"正在行驶","explanation":"가다：车辆行驶；-고 있다 表示正在持续，以最高速度行驶。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"2","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가고","audio":"/audio/1fb46b7cd8a51290e6be.mp3"}},{"text":"있습니다.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있습니다","audio":"/audio/de7385b84e32dd836700.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"656cf6c32585f66d","term":"죄송하다","zh":"抱歉，愧疚","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3","entryId":"91763","definition":"好像犯了错一样感觉十分过意不去。","pronunciation":["죄ː송하다","줴ː송하다"]},{"id":"1d333b8427106c20","term":"이미","zh":"已经","audio":"/audio/1d333b8427106c200840.mp3","entryId":"71159","definition":"某事发生的时间比现在早地。","pronunciation":["이ː미"]},{"id":"97b8be84b3d009c4","term":"최고","zh":"最高","audio":"/audio/97b8be84b3d009c4b9b1.mp3","entryId":"47976","definition":"表示程度已达极限。","pronunciation":["최ː고","췌ː고"]},{"id":"c03f7e871a4127c4","term":"속도","zh":"速度","audio":"/audio/c03f7e871a4127c448d9.mp3","entryId":"64215","definition":"物体移动或事情进行的快慢。","pronunciation":["속또"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"行驶","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"交通工具向目的地移动；这里指车辆以最高速度行驶。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/686d8be19135a01fbbd2.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.6,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=86940","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"21","sourceLevel":"초급","day":38,"sequenceScore":1.7259,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["时间也太长了吧。没办法开快一点吗？","很抱歉，已经以最高速度行驶了。","妈妈，怎么有年糕？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["时间也太长了吧。没办法开快一点吗？","很抱歉，已经以最高速度行驶了。","妈妈，怎么有年糕？"],"answer":1}]}
